# The Play service-account key is passed explicitly to each action in the Fastfile
# (json_key_data: ENV["PLAY_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_JSON"]). It is intentionally NOT set
# here: on this fastlane/supply version `json_key_data(...)` is not a valid Appfile
# method and raised `undefined method 'json_key_data'`, which aborted Appfile
# evaluation before `package_name` was registered — making supply fail with
# "No value found for 'package_name'".
package_name("de.velospot")

